italic" style="font-size:90%;">WebFetch</span><span id="A1.T5.6.2.3.1.1.23" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><span id="A1.T5.6.2.3.1.1.24" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">TodoList</span><span id="A1.T5.6.2.3.1.1.25" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><span id="A1.T5.6.2.3.1.1.26" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">think</span><span id="A1.T5.6.2.3.1.1.27" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><span id="A1.T5.6.2.3.1.1.28" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">ContextStore</span><span id="A1.T5.6.2.3.1.1.29" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (Cookbook). Sub-agent delegation enabled.</span></span>
