<section id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Design rationale.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Pawn represents the “blank slate” scenario: a functional but minimal agent that optimizers can expand through tool additions, prompt engineering, and architectural changes. Knight represents the “refinement” scenario: an agent already incorporating best practices from the GAIA leaderboard, testing whether optimizers can identify remaining inefficiencies in sophisticated workflows.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
